- [ ] `DUOS_GATE_GREEDY_WIN_FLOOR` (0.7) is in `crates/ai/src/config.rs`.
- [ ] The four daily `duos_gate` tests pass.
- [ ] Every test above passes, the existing `duos::` and `duos_gate` tests included.
- [ ] rustfmt, catalog, patches, rulings, clippy and cargo tests are green, and `classify --claims` reports no problem.
